<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>User Study</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also conducted a user study where we prepared the generation results of DVD and TRELLIS with different image and text prompts. In total, there are 25 image prompts and 25 text prompts. We presented interactive visualizations of the generated voxels, meshes, and rendered videos, and asked the users to choose their preferred voxels and meshes (see an example screenshot in Figure <a href="#A7.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix G User Study ‣ DVD: Discrete Voxel Diffusion for 3D Generation and Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>). We collect data with around 600 trials. The results are shown in Figure <a href="#A7.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ Appendix G User Study ‣ DVD: Discrete Voxel Diffusion for 3D Generation and Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>. We can see that for image-based tasks, DVD is preferred among users, and for text-based tasks, both methods are on the same level.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F14" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2605.07971v1/user_preference.svg" id="A7.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:333/222;" width="333" height="222"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>Pie graph of user preference.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F15" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2605.07971v1/figures/scrnshot-2026-05-06_162809_412.png" id="A7.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/775;" width="476" height="775" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>An example screenshot of the user study. The question at the bottom asks about the preferred mesh and voxel.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Perturbing and Inpainting Algorithm</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Appendix H Perturbing and Inpainting Algorithm ‣ DVD: Discrete Voxel Diffusion for 3D Generation and Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, we introduced the algorithm for generating a block pattern for augmented training. In algorithm <a href="#alg3" title="Algorithm 3 ‣ Appendix H Perturbing and Inpainting Algorithm ‣ DVD: Discrete Voxel Diffusion for 3D Generation and Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, we present the sampling and inpainting algorithm. The additional lines needed for inpainting are colored in blue; the sampling algorithm is modified from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">39</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Generation of Block-Structured Masks</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
            
            
           Batch size <math id="alg2.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>, spatial size <math id="alg2.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, dimension <math id="alg2.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{dim}\in\{1,2,3\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>dim</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{dim}\in\{1,2,3\}</annotation></semantics></math>
, set of block side lengths <math id="alg2.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}=\{\ell_{1},\dots,\ell_{L_{m}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}=\{\ell_{1},\dots,\ell_{L_{m}}\}</annotation></semantics></math>,
target masked fraction <math id="alg2.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{b}\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{b}\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> for each sample <math id="alg2.l0.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b\in\{1,\dots,B\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b\in\{1,\dots,B\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
           Initialize binary masks <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}_{b}\leftarrow\mathbf{0}\in\{0,1\}^{N^{\mathrm{dim}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>dim</mi></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}_{b}\leftarrow\mathbf{0}\in\{0,1\}^{N^{\mathrm{dim}}}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
           Compute total volume <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V\leftarrow N^{\mathrm{dim}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>dim</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V\leftarrow N^{\mathrm{dim}}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
           <span id="alg2.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each sample <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=1,\dots,B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=1,\dots,B</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Per-scale maximum counts)</span> For each length <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{j}\in\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{j}\in\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math>, set

<table id="A8.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A8.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{j}\leftarrow\ell_{j}^{\mathrm{dim}},\qquad m_{b,j}^{\max}\leftarrow\left\lceil\frac{t_{b}\,V}{A_{j}}\right\rceil." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>dim</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>max</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>⌉</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{j}\leftarrow\ell_{j}^{\mathrm{dim}},\qquad m_{b,j}^{\max}\leftarrow\left\lceil\frac{t_{b}\,V}{A_{j}}\right\rceil.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Random allocation across scales)</span> Sample i.i.d. weights <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{b,j}\sim\mathrm{Uniform}(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>Uniform</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{b,j}\sim\mathrm{Uniform}(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> and normalize

<table id="A8.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A8.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{b,j}\leftarrow\frac{u_{b,j}}{\sum_{k=1}^{L_{m}}u_{b,k}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></msubsup><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{b,j}\leftarrow\frac{u_{b,j}}{\sum_{k=1}^{L_{m}}u_{b,k}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
            Compute the number of blocks at each scale

<table id="A8.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A8.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{b,j}\leftarrow\left\lceil w_{b,j}\,m_{b,j}^{\max}\right\rceil." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>⌈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>max</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{b,j}\leftarrow\left\lceil w_{b,j}\,m_{b,j}^{\max}\right\rceil.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each length <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{j}\in\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{j}\in\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg2.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=1,\dots,m_{b,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=1,\dots,m_{b,j}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
              Sample a start position <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{s}\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}^{\mathrm{dim}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mi>dim</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{s}\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}^{\mathrm{dim}}</annotation></semantics></math> uniformly (with truncation at borders).

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
              Define the block

<table id="A8.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A8.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{B}(\mathbf{s},\ell_{j})=\big\{\mathbf{v}\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}^{\mathrm{dim}}:s_{d}\leq v_{d}&lt;s_{d}+\ell_{j}\;\;\forall d\in\{1,\dots,\mathrm{dim}\}\big\}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mi>dim</mi></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{B}(\mathbf{s},\ell_{j})=\big\{\mathbf{v}\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}^{\mathrm{dim}}:s_{d}\leq v_{d}&lt;s_{d}+\ell_{j}\;\;\forall d\in\{1,\dots,\mathrm{dim}\}\big\},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>where indices exceeding <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N-1</annotation></semantics></math> are clipped.

</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
              Set <math id="alg2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}_{b}[\mathbf{v}]\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}_{b}[\mathbf{v}]\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg2.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}\in\mathcal{B}(\mathbf{s},\ell_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐯</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℬ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}\in\mathcal{B}(\mathbf{s},\ell_{j})</annotation></semantics></math> (union of blocks).

</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
             <span id="alg2.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
           <span id="alg2.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l14.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
           Optionally, compute the realized masked fraction for each sample

<table id="A8.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A8.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{b}\leftarrow\frac{1}{V}\sum_{\mathbf{v}}\mathbf{M}_{b}[\mathbf{v}]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>𝐯</mi></munder><mrow><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐯</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{b}\leftarrow\frac{1}{V}\sum_{\mathbf{v}}\mathbf{M}_{b}[\mathbf{v}].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l15a" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l15a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
            
            
           Block masks <math id="alg2.l15a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}_{1},\dots,\mathbf{M}_{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}_{1},\dots,\mathbf{M}_{B}</annotation></semantics></math> (and <math id="alg2.l15a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{1},\dots,t_{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{1},\dots,t_{B}</annotation></semantics></math> if desired).

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> USDM Ancestral Sampling with Optional Inpainting</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
            
            
           Initial input <math id="alg3.l0.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{1:L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{1:L}</annotation></semantics></math> (noise or corrupted input) at <math id="alg3.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=1</annotation></semantics></math> (e.g., pure noise), number of steps <math id="alg3.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, optional inpainting parameters <math id="alg3.l0.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{\mathbf{M}^{1:L},\mathbf{C}^{1:L}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi>𝐌</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐂</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathbf{M}^{1:L},\mathbf{C}^{1:L}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, where mask <math id="alg3.l0.m5" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{M}^{1:L}\in\{0,1\}^{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐌</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}^{1:L}\in\{0,1\}^{L}</annotation></semantics></math> and target classes <math id="alg3.l0.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{C}^{1:L}\in\{0,\dots,K-1\}^{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐂</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{C}^{1:L}\in\{0,\dots,K-1\}^{L}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
